    "created_at": "2021-03-25T19:57:33Z",
    "updated_at": "2021-03-25T19:57:33Z",
    "body": "As a heads-up for anyone else stumbling across this issue: the starship init scripts used to overwrite `PROMPT` every time you pressed ENTER. While this was nice in some cases, it didn't always play well with other frameworks (esp. the built-in zsh prompts framework). This got changed in #2428, which fixes these issues, but may expose broken initialization in your initscripts. \r\n\r\nDouble-check to make sure you're following [David's suggestions](https://github.com/starship/starship/issues/2508#issuecomment-807081257).",
